second artist, birth date for a different person, or second sport is evidence to retain it. Check each proposed deletion once more against all originals before producing the final short list.\nInput: {\"question\": \"Who was the head of government of County of Bentheim?\", \"slot_hint\": \"person\", \"all_original_sources\": {\"D1S1\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 118, \"text\": \"As the sun set over the rolling hills of County Bentheim, a sense of tranquility settled over the quaint German towns.\"}, \"D1S2\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 119, \"end\": 232, \"text\": \"It was a crisp autumn evening, and the air was alive with the sweet scent of ripe apples from the local orchards.\"}, \"D1S3\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 233, \"end\": 313, \"text\": \"In the midst of this peaceful scene, a peculiar figure emerged from the shadows.\"}, \"D1S4\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 314, \"end\": 439, \"text\": \"Marius-Gabriel Gheorghiță, a man with a rugged, weathered face and piercing brown eyes, stepped out of his sleek black sedan.\"}, \"D1S5\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 440, \"end\": 535, \"text\": \"His Romanian accent was unmistakable as he greeted the waiting officials with a firm handshake.\"}, \"D1S6\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 536, \"end\": 678, \"text\": \"The locals couldn't help but notice the air of authority that surrounded him, an aura that commanded respect without ever having to demand it.\"}, \"D1S7\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 679, \"end\": 836, \"text\": \"It was as if he had an innate understanding of the land, the people, and the intricate web of politics that governed this picturesque corner of Lower Saxony.\"}, \"D1S8\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 837, \"end\": 987, \"text\": \"As he made his way through the crowded town hall, whispers began to circulate about the mysterious stranger who had seemingly appeared out of nowhere.\"}, \"D1S9\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 988, \"end\": 1133, \"text\": \"Rumors swirled about his past, about the whispers of a distant Romanian village, Pârgărești, where he had cut his teeth in the world of politics.\"}, \"D1S10\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1134, \"end\": 1351, \"text\": \"Some claimed to have seen him strolling along the banks of the Bistrița River, deep in conversation with local leaders, while others spoke of his uncanny ability to navigate the complex landscape of European politics.\"}, \"D1S11\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1352, \"end\": 1452, \"text\": \"As Gheorghiță took his seat at the head of the table, a sense of anticipation settled over the room.\"}, \"D1S12\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1453, \"end\": 1604, \"text\": \"The officials of County Bentheim exchanged nervous glances, unsure of what to make of this enigmatic figure who seemed to hold their fate in his hands.\"}, \"D1S13\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1605, \"end\": 1814, \"text\": \"And yet, as he began to speak, his words dripped with a quiet confidence, a sense of purpose that left no doubt – Marius-Gabriel Gheorghiță was a man who knew exactly what he was doing, and where he was going.\"}, \"D1S14\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1815, \"end\": 1951, \"text\": \"The room was transfixed as he outlined his vision for the county's future, a future that seemed to shimmer with promise and possibility.\"}, \"D1S15\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1952, \"end\": 2057, \"text\": \"It was as if he had spent years studying the intricacies of Bentheim's history, its people, and its land.\"}, \"D1S16\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 2058, \"end\": 2141, \"text\": \"The officials nodded in agreement, mesmerized by the persuasive power of his words.\"}, \"D1S17\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 2142, \"end\": 2266, \"text\": \"As the meeting drew to a close, Gheorghiță rose from his seat, his eyes scanning the room with an air of quiet satisfaction.\"}, \"D2S1\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 68, \"text\": \"Title: The Unyielding Leader of Bentheim: Friedrich Kethorn's Tenure\"}, \"D2S2\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 70, \"end\": 196, \"text\": \"In the picturesque landscape of Lower Saxony, Germany, lies the County of Bentheim, a region steeped in history and tradition.\"}, \"D2S3\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 197, \"end\": 316, \"text\": \"Amidst the rolling hills and quaint villages, one man stood tall, leaving an indelible mark on the county's governance.\"}, \"D2S4\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 317, \"end\": 454, \"text\": \"Friedrich Kethorn, a German politician of unwavering dedication, held the reins of power as the head of government of County of Bentheim.\"}, \"D2S5\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 455, \"end\": 532, \"text\": \"The year was 1920, and the aftermath of World War I had left Germany reeling.\"}, \"D2S6\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 533, \"end\": 668, \"text\": \"The Weimar Republic, established in 1919, was still finding its footing, and the country was grappling with the consequences of defeat.\"}, \"D2S7\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 669, \"end\": 766, \"text\": \"In this tumultuous era, Friedrich Kethorn emerged as a beacon of hope for the people of Bentheim.\"}, \"D2S8\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 767, \"end\": 904, \"text\": \"His leadership was characterized by a deep understanding of the region's unique challenges and a steadfast commitment to its development.\"}, \"D2S9\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 905, \"end\": 1018, \"text\": \"As the head of government, Kethorn tackled the daunting task of rebuilding and revitalizing the county's economy.\"}, \"D2S10\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1019, \"end\": 1122, \"text\": \"He implemented a series of innovative policies, focusing on agriculture, infrastructure, and education.\"}, \"D2S11\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1123, \"end\": 1253, \"text\": \"His vision was to create a self-sustaining economy, where the local population could thrive and contribute to the region's growth.\"}, \"D2S12\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1254, \"end\": 1360, \"text\": \"One of Kethorn's most notable achievements was the establishment of the Bentheim Agricultural Cooperative.\"}, \"D2S13\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1361, \"end\": 1483, \"text\": \"This pioneering initiative brought together local farmers, providing them with access to resources, training, and markets.\"}, \"D2S14\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1484, \"end\": 1662, \"text\": \"The cooperative not only improved agricultural productivity but also fostered a sense of community among the farmers, who were now empowered to take control of their own destiny.\"}, \"D2S15\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1663, \"end\": 1730, \"text\": \"Kethorn's leadership was not limited to economic development alone.\"}, \"D2S16\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1731, \"end\": 1854, \"text\": \"He was a passionate advocate for education, recognizing its transformative power in shaping the future of Bentheim's youth.\"}, \"D2S17\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1855, \"end\": 2010, \"text\": \"During his tenure, he oversaw the construction of new schools, the recruitment of qualified teachers, and the introduction of vocational training programs.\"}, \"D2S18\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 2011, \"end\": 2200, \"text\": \"These initiatives helped to raise the educational standards in the county, equipping the next generation with the skills and knowledge necessary to succeed in an increasingly complex world.\"}, \"D2S19\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 2201, \"end\": 2286, \"text\": \"The people of Bentheim adored Kethorn for his unwavering commitment to their welfare.\"}, \"D2S20\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 2287, \"end\": 2390, \"text\": \"He was a leader who listened, who understood their concerns, and who worked tirelessly to address them.\"}, \"D2S21\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 2391, \"end\": 2501, \"text\": \"His door was always open, and his willingness to engage with the community earned him their trust and respect.\"}}, \"original_cards\": [{\"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"card_id\": \"d1:c0\", \"entity\": \"Marius-Gabriel Gheorghiță\", \"scope\": \"County of Bentheim\", \"claim\": \"Marius-Gabriel Gheorghiță was the head of government of County of Bentheim.\", \"answer\": \"Marius-Gabriel Gheorghiță\", \"quote\": \"As Gheorghiță took his seat at the head of the table, a sense of anticipation settled over the room. The officials of County Bentheim exchanged nervous glances, unsure of what to make of this enigmatic figure who seemed to hold their fate in his hands.\", \"original_document_number\": 1}, {\"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"card_id\": \"d2:c0\", \"entity\": \"Friedrich Kethorn\", \"scope\": \"County of Bentheim\", \"claim\": \"Friedrich Kethorn was the head of government of County of Bentheim.\", \"answer\": \"Friedrich Kethorn\", \"quote\": \"Friedrich Kethorn, a German politician of unwavering dedication, held the reins of power as the head of government of County of Bentheim.\", \"original_document_number\": 2}], \"R5_answers\": [\"Marius-Gabriel Gheorghiță\", \"Friedrich Kethorn\"], \"candidates\": [{\"id\": \"C0\", \"answer\": \"Marius-Gabriel Gheorghiță\", \"origin\": \"R5\"}, {\"id\": \"C1\", \"answer\": \"Friedrich Kethorn\", \"origin\": \"R5\"}]}"
